[I] Perl module Class-Accessor

[T] Class::Accessor automatically generates accessor and mutator methods for
[T] the data fields of Perl classes, saving the copy and paste of almost
[T] identical methods. Class::Accessor::Fast and Class::Accessor::Faster
[T] provide faster variants, the latter using an array based object.

[U] https://metacpan.org/release/Class-Accessor

